Z2_PSTR:45209 '= "There is a large, white animal partly hidden behind some trees."
Z2_PSTR:45228 '= "You catch a glimpse of something white between two hedges."
Z2_PSTR:45244 '= "A unicorn is cropping grass on the other side of the room. A gold key hangs from a ribbon around its neck."
