Z2_LDESC:179 '= "200 neatly stacked zorkmid bills are here."
Z2_FDESC:179 '= "On the floor sit 200 neatly stacked zorkmid bills."
Z2_TEXT:179 '= "Each bill is worth 100 zorkmids, and bears the legend \"In Frobs We Trust\"."
