Z2_ATTR:198:18 = 1
Z2_ATTR:198:26 = 1
Z2_LDESC:198 '= "Lying in the dust, and covered with mold, is a purple book."
Z2_TEXT:198 '= "This book is written in a tongue with which I am unfamiliar. Assuming that one can indeed tell a book by its cover, it is likely filled with purple prose, the like of which is rarely seen outside the Great Underground Empire."
Z2_SIZE:198 = 10
Z2_PARENT:199 = 44
Z2_SIBLING:199 = 211
Z2_CHILD:199 = 0
Z2_ATTR:199:14 = 1
Z2_SIZE:199 = 0
Z2_PARENT:200 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:200 = 2
Z2_CHILD:200 = 20
Z2_ATTR:200:12 = 1
Z2_ATTR:200:19 = 1
Z2_LDESC:200 '= "This is a large rectangular room. The east and west walls were used for storing safety deposit boxes, but all have been carefully removed by evil persons. To the east, west, and south of the room are large doorways. The northern \"wall\" of the room is a shimmering curtain of light. In the center of the room is a large stone cube, about 10 feet on a side. Engraved on the side of the cube is some lettering."
Z2_SIZE:200 = 5
Z2_PARENT:201 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:201 = 248
Z2_CHILD:201 = 150
Z2_ATTR:201:12 = 1
Z2_LDESC:201 '= "You are in the dragon's lair, where the rock walls are scarred by flame. A blackened doorway leads to the south."
Z2_SIZE:201 = 5
Z2_PARENT:202 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:202 = 19
Z2_CHILD:202 = 0
Z2_ATTR:202:12 = 1
Z2_LDESC:202 '= "A small room with oddly angled walls and passages in all directions."
Z2_SIZE:202 = 5
Z2_PARENT:203 = 94
Z2_SIBLING:203 = 0
Z2_CHILD:203 = 0
Z2_ATTR:203:13 = 1
Z2_ATTR:203:14 = 1
Z2_SIZE:203 = 5
Z2_PARENT:204 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:204 = 243
Z2_CHILD:204 = 0
Z2_ATTR:204:12 = 1
Z2_LDESC:204 '= "This room was used by holders of safety deposit boxes to view their contents. On the north side of the room is a sign which says:\n\n\"Remain here while the teller retrieves your safety deposit box. When you are finished, leave the box, and exit to the south. Safety deposit boxes cannot be removed from this room!\n\nThank You for Banking at the Zork!\" "
Z2_SIZE:204 = 5
Z2_PARENT:205 = 62
Z2_SIBLING:205 = 70
Z2_CHILD:205 = 0
Z2_SIZE:205 = 5
Z2_PARENT:206 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:206 = 184
Z2_CHILD:206 = 213
Z2_ATTR:206:12 = 1
Z2_LDESC:206 '= "A winding corridor is filled with cobwebs. Some are broken and the dust on the floor is disturbed. The trend of the twists and turns is northeast to southwest. On the north side of one twist, high up, is a narrow crack."
Z2_SIZE:206 = 5
Z2_PARENT:207 = 37
Z2_SIBLING:207 = 206
Z2_CHILD:207 = 214
Z2_ATTR:207:12 = 1
Z2_LDESC:207 '= "This is a small chamber carved out of the rock at the end of a short crawl. On the wall is crudely chiseled the number \"8\"."
Z2_SIZE:207 = 5
