Z2_FDESC:220 '= "On the ground is a small, worn piece of paper."
Z2_TEXT:220 '= "The paper is barely readable. You can only make out \"... valuables are completely safe ... advanced magic technology ... impossible to take valuables from the depository ... either teller's ... Many customers faint ... teller pops in ... seems to walk through ... walls ...\""
