Z2_LDESC:246 '= "There is an engraved zorkmid here."
Z2_FDESC:246 '= "On the floor is a priceless gold zorkmid (a valuable collector's item)."
Z2_TEXT:246 '= "This is a beautiful octagonal coin bearing the legends \"Ten Thousand Zorkmids\" and \"In Frobs We Trust\"."
